# 05_loop — iterate until a condition is true.
# Demonstrates: loop( body ) until( condition ) with a bounded
# iteration ceiling. The body runs, its output feeds the next turn,
# and the loop stops when the condition evaluates to true.

@config:verbosity=2

{ attempts: 0, message: "turn 1" }
-> loop(
    { attempts: attempts + 1, message: "turn " + string(attempts + 1) }
    -> log.info
) until( attempts >= 3 )
